<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Father, source of glory, naming every fam’ly;</l><l>And the Son upholding all by His almighty power;</l><l>Holy Spirit, filling the vast scene of glory—</l><l>O glorious Fulness, let our hearts adore!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God supreme, we worship now in holy splendour,</l><l>Head of the vast scene of bliss, before Thy face we fall!</l><l>Majesty and greatness, glory, praise and power</l><l>To Thee belong, eternal Source of all!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
